   <indicator ascending="1" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase in crop production by at least 10 percent within four years after rehabilitation of the project schemes.</narrative>
    </title>
    <baseline iso-date="2006-08-01" value="0" year="2006">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN"></narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2006-08-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2013-11-30"></period-end>
     <target value="2.5% in schemes completed in Y6, 5% in schemes com"></target>
     <actual value="To be determined.">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Survey results of 19 WUAs (of which 6 rehabilitated under OIP-1 or OIP-2) in the command area of 6 off-farm schemes rehabilitatedunder the WMIP in 2010, show that irrigated area increased from 18267 to 18345 ha (0.5%).  Yield per ha changes are less evident,with significant increase (80%) in fodder crops, and decrease in cotton (5%) and vegetables (22%). Most notable change is adecrease in the area of winter wheat (-15%) to an increase towards more intensive irrigated crops. Therefore, preliminary resultsare mildly positive, but further analysis for the ICRR will provide clarity,</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
